# Spring Batch POCs

Collection of Spring Batch proof-of-concept implementations.

## Modules

### batch-demo
Basic chunk processing

### batch-demo-tasklet
Tasklet based execution

### batch-demo-rest
REST API integration

### batch-demo-mongo
MongoDB integration

### batch-demo-kinesis
AWS Kinesis integration

### batch-demo-stepfunction
AWS Step Functions orchestration

## Tech Stack

- Java 17
- Spring Boot
- Spring Batch
- Maven
- MongoDB
- AWS Kinesis
- AWS Step Functions
